# Two Simulacrum Synthesizers (mana value 3 each): the second one entering is "another artifact you control with mana value 3 or greater"
# for the first, which makes one Construct; the second does not trigger on itself, so there is exactly one Construct (it would be
# Construct#1 and Construct#2 otherwise). Both scry 2 as they enter (the library is left in place). Artifacts: five Moxen, two
# Synthesizers and the Construct itself: an 8/8.

